# Large lossless source masters for the visual-asset pipeline (SOURCE -> MASTER
# -> WEB OPTIMIZED per WEB DAVID PORTO nuevas ideas/26_.../section 16). Only
# the final web-optimized outputs (assets/*.webp) are tracked; the PNG
# sources stay local so regeneration is possible without repo bloat.
